{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fogrest: The Whisper of Harbingers",
    "steam_appid": 3368300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/a13ebaf3ba21c4a7756ee77effde3335.avif?t=1736430928\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fogrest</strong> is a 2D pixel style adventure game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown accident has turned into a real catastrophe for mankind. The mysterious fog has become a habitat for creepy creatures. Those who managed to survive are now forced to hide, pray and wait for rescue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.poster.avif?t=1736430928\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.webm?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.mp4?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an ordinary factory worker go on a deadly dangerous journey through the ruins of civilization. Along the way you will meet people with unique stories. Bargain and exchange items that will be useful to you on your journey. Every choice you make will have consequences. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.poster.avif?t=1736430928\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.webm?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.mp4?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep story</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/a13ebaf3ba21c4a7756ee77effde3335.avif?t=1736430928\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fogrest</strong> is a 2D pixel style adventure game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown accident has turned into a real catastrophe for mankind. The mysterious fog has become a habitat for creepy creatures. Those who managed to survive are now forced to hide, pray and wait for rescue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.poster.avif?t=1736430928\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.webm?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/bcb1faafccc123f42201fdff64df2757.mp4?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an ordinary factory worker go on a deadly dangerous journey through the ruins of civilization. Along the way you will meet people with unique stories. Bargain and exchange items that will be useful to you on your journey. Every choice you make will have consequences. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.poster.avif?t=1736430928\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.webm?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368300/extras/597f44c0ec5f739bbdbd65cfce7b255a.mp4?t=1736430928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep story</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fogrest is a 2D pixel adventure game. A fog has descended on the land, monstrous creatures are waiting to attack. Make your way through dark forests and deserted towns to find answers.",
